  "ai_summary": "Devs aren\u2019t \"cooked,\" but the market is bifurcating. IT consultancy stocks are collapsing (down 20-40%), and Big Tech headcount is shrinking (Meta/Amazon down ~9%). Conversely, AI lab hiring is surging, and the Indeed Index shows software dev momentum up 15% YoY, indicating resilient demand outside traditional outsourcing. We aren't actually cooked; we\u2019re just being moved from the slow cooker of outsourcing into the high-pressure air fryer of AI development.",
